<title>USA: Home Depot declines to buy Reno-Depot.</title>
<headline>Home Depot declines to buy Reno-Depot.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Depot Inc said Monday it was declining to buy Reno-Depot Inc, an 11-store home improvement retailer operating in the Canadian province of Quebec.</p>
<p>On January 27, Molson Cos Ltd, majority owner of Reno-Depot, told Home Depot of its decision to sell its interest in the retailer.</p>
<p>Under terms of an agreement with Molson, Home Depot had a right of first offer but had to act within 45 days of notice from Molson.</p>
</text>
